{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8ebcf7ecfc00de74446ecc0dbfe35e5ee788fec126918c77ac5c3a3a606fa",
      "text": "电视台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c76657c0944e4f0bbd67db25dd4f79ecd4eb6eca897c71532c93975c11d1a48",
      "text": "今天非常感谢各位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69cbf4abb35cc0017c76902786d5650e3cbcb6933bf124ba7b15ce70005b5e50",
      "text": "哎呀～，今天能聊一聊真是太好了！FRAME那种认真的\n氛围，跟我们这档新闻节目简直是绝配。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b7f5ac14441e4dd2b5d63703a5c1c14e7f441b155923d65cc27c00a881d8ac",
      "text": "而且作为偶像也非常棒！\n感觉能够很好地向年轻群体推广这档节目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab16a6c268355ac005ff8384eec1be173fa12889f57db0c94c4b44f318386561",
      "text": "让我更加确信向你们发出邀请真是没看走眼。\n接下来，我们节目《7 in LIVE！》就拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af78e6406206cae72f88b0c71910dddf6e6af6de7eed6ab2b3a2397e80661f82",
      "text": "好的，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bae02e4ea65b59bae3439db8e3351ac42e60e25dfc5543ca6fedae1f7e44464",
      "text": "能被那么夸奖真是太开心了！\n商谈进行得很顺利真是太好啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7a13f88951013f9da18e1058b4461633d78d82ea6ab523da765a731b195449",
      "text": "受到那么大的期待固然很有压力，\n但这也代表着很有挑战的价值啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2892332e4f2f33a08cbbd1678a35a21252ecc965da182694040d2ea701f392b1",
      "text": "啊啊。回事务所之后，马上开个作战会议吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー，拜托你的协助了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5455b97f1840b10a7356082919667171c587f584ca997415305e1a4de4fc6aa8",
      "text": "当然了。\n我也会全力支持大家的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000085:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000092:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75776b5d09a533e943215fce462b6ec7f4942baddad59ab6346116393a34d6fc",
      "text": "不好意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000094:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97446bfe12fb24b98a709558bb7d10e9e57142e7e8f956aaf51da8e4555cfb88",
      "text": "手机电量耗尽了……！\n刚刚才看到\n关于工作的新消息！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000096:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f676eceb661d5c27f1bae383a2aaa3fa9a9aebbec27d4994030356cc75ab6356",
      "text": "我们居然能作为嘉宾出演\n节目的各个环节，\n太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000098:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47158e8fdbf663d6c7139919d13a0988b4a2146da49405fd8155469d8caf2500",
      "text": "龙负责天气预报，\n信玄负责新闻资讯，\n我负责烦恼咨询。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000100:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da43de9655a695c9bf6a1a642ac14e9d0d060518e9da1243fdd67e7cddc6af3",
      "text": "都是跟我们各自的前职业\n多多少少有些关联的\n环节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000102:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c81d3c96c1e29f0d42b30db7e8bea595a024dd8ea20af66537a2236e7840f2a",
      "text": "在各自的环节活跃的同时，\n出演当天还必须\n圆满完成主题曲的现场演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000104:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d253440884e1ce97de74265d5c649765a0bbb3aaade62627563d52ceb2fad1a6",
      "text": "要应对多项任务，\n体力果然才是最关键的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000106:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06f682394f6cf4dd4f1246c0a9d6ca6adcaceb0ec445fa388bd6342cc4f5b2f6",
      "text": "那么从明天开始，立刻增加以\n提高基础体力为目标的\n训练量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000108:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f17e9281db32f5a27a96decedbc23c96c484ef1eb4e352553796bd9d572641",
      "text": "请多注意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000108:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea669ebeeebdde2afc0d2ae3f422fe480d1c27f139770e9929cfcec825b36413",
      "text": "训练的量\n请务必多加注意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000111:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd23ce0199bf44d52650ad2c37d06b10b9b6146c63bdf28938dc72ce389b521a",
      "text": "啊啊，我知道的。要是量完尺寸的\n服装穿不进去了，\n那可就麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000113:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f81466685884fd62aad44f6bd55399c95e6fd4812bc2038a8ba2aef39de2595",
      "text": "放心吧，为了避免练过头，\n我会好好盯紧他们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
